{"id":"88690f8e312ca0293d9f269143b31d338f217f0a","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244364","title":"Claude 基础款 20 刀的 opus 5.5 够用吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"yayiji","excerpt":"Claude - @yayiji - 想订阅 claude 基础款 20 刀，不知是否够用？我想知道是和 gpt 6 solo 比，用量差别如何，如果相当的话，我会考虑一下，希望在用的人能给我一些 info 。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/yayiji\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7daf/c7a0/351624_large.png?m=1706530376\" alt=\"yayiji\" data-uid=\"351624\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/yayiji\">yayiji</a> · <span title=\"2026-09-23 23:14:05 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> · 1802 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>想订阅 claude 基础款 20 刀，不知是否够用？</p>\n<p>我想知道是和 gpt 6 solo 比，用量差别如何，</p>\n<p>如果相当的话，我会考虑一下，</p>\n<p>希望在用的人能给我一些 info 。</p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121335\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/913e/ce81/546340_normal.png?m=1711424729\" alt=\"581996\" data-uid=\"546340\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/581996\">581996</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 23:18:56 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>相当够用 不考虑封号的话 比同等级的 Plus 耐用多了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121342\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4a0/452d/556606_normal.png?m=1784530402\" alt=\"Julaoshi\" data-uid=\"556606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Julaoshi\">Julaoshi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 23:24:21 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>同感。codex plus 几乎没法很，GPT 也就 5.5 耐用，5.6sol 都不耐用。<br>Claude code 用 opus 5 的时候就比 codex plus 耐用。5.5 就更胜 codex plus 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121403\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4ea8/d10b/95443_normal.png?m=1532251063\" alt=\"hahasong\" data-uid=\"95443\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hahasong\">hahasong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 23:57:00 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>必须够，5.5-medium &gt; 5-high ，明显秒回思考行云流水</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121430\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4249e407b17a518d467a1e17cf22cfd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zuosiruan\" data-uid=\"204104\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zuosiruan\">zuosiruan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 00:27:33 +08:00\">23h 58m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>比 5.5sol 多。但得预防封号，封号概率远大于 gpt</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121454\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 00:57:13 +08:00\">23h 29m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>当然闭眼选 Claude，唯一的缺点是封号的风险。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121469\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bdbd/5ebf/12318_normal.png?m=1717058068\" alt=\"NickyHaris\" data-uid=\"12318\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/NickyHaris\">NickyHaris</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 01:09:38 +08:00\">23h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>真的够用吗，我一直用 sonnet 5 低频开发，将将够用，哪位知道 sonnet 和 opus 5.5 的 token 消耗差多少吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121504\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b37cf0250905038918962f8e90041e4a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"defa21312\" data-uid=\"850219\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/defa21312\">defa21312</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 02:27:58 +08:00\">21h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>够用，是 openai plus 的 3 倍，我通过我本机的精确统计脚本+claude 的 week 已用接口，求得 claude pro 的纯使用 opus5.5 的周额度是 290 美元，而 gpt pro5x 纯使用 astra 的周额度是 300 美元，甚至可以得出 claude 20 刀等于 openai 100 刀的幽默结论</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121725\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c96c53858648f2b814de6ceeb7b4a9f9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"beafreey\" data-uid=\"681832\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/beafreey\">beafreey</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 08:50:06 +08:00\">15h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也想放弃了 GPT 的 plus 续费，现在 GPT 连贯的降智降额度操作让我的好感度败完了，但是 Claude 又封号厉害，不知道有没有风险低一些的使用方式。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121850\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/26640cd1aaffd54b3ddab0873c1d132e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Breacher\" data-uid=\"396993\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Breacher\">Breacher</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:10:25 +08:00\">15h 15m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>昨天开了个账号，今早订阅。电脑开了远程，出门用手机安排个任务，立刻被封号了😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"yayiji · 1 day ago · 1802 views 想订阅 claude 基础款 20 刀，不知是否够用？ 我想知道是和 gpt 6 solo 比，用量差别如何， 如果相当的话，我会考虑一下， 希望在用的人能给我一些 info 。 1 581996 1 day ago 1 相当够用 不考虑封号的话 比同等级的 Plus 耐用多了 3 Julaoshi 1 day ago 同感。codex plus 几乎没法很，GPT 也就 5.5 耐用，5.6sol 都不耐用。Claude